### 2. Request DTO and all Bean Validation annotations

The `@RequestBody` type is `OwnerFieldsDto` (NOT the `Owner` entity). Bean Validation runs against this DTO because of `@Valid` in the interface.

`/home/daniel/sandbox/target/generated-sources/openapi/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/dto/OwnerFieldsDto.java`

Constraint annotations (they sit on the getters):
- `firstName` (lines 81-84): `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)`
- `lastName` (lines 102-105): `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)`
- `title` (lines 123-126): `@Size(min = 1, max = 10)`
- `address` (lines 144-147): `@Size(min = 1, max = 255)`
- `addressLine1` (lines 165-168): `@Size(min = 1, max = 255)`
