### 3. Custom validators / `@Validated` logic

- Interface `@Validated` (OwnersApi line 44) — enables method-parameter validation.
- There is a custom constraint in the codebase — `PetAgeValidation` / `PetAgeValidator` under `src/main/java/.../rest/validation/` — but it applies to **pets**, NOT to owners. There are **no custom validators on the owner create path.** All owner-side "validation" beyond the standard JSR-380 DTO annotations is imperative code inside `addOwner` (the telephone/address/postcode/duplicate/capacity/date checks listed in §1).

