```

`saveOwner(Owner)` (lines 232-237) — the actual persist:
```java
    @Override
    @Transactional
    public void saveOwner(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException {
        ownerRepository.save(owner);

    }
```

(`findOwnerById(int)`, lines 200-204, is only hit on the idempotency-replay branch.) Note the controller method itself is not `@Transactional`; each service call is its own transaction, so the multiple `findAllOwners()` reads and the final `saveOwner` are separate transactions.

